description: Prevent unnecessary infrastructure and cloud dependencies
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Overbuilding

Do not add these without explicit user request:

- Redis.
- Queue systems.
- BullMQ or Redis workers.
- PostgreSQL.
- S3 or cloud object storage.
- Long-running job workers.
- Auth providers.
- Separate backend frameworks.
- Serverless-only assumptions.

A simple cleanup script invoked by cron or Docker Compose is allowed.
